<title>JAPAN: Japan 6-mth T-bill auction lowest price 99.710.</title>
<headline>Japan 6-mth T-bill auction lowest price 99.710.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The auction of 1.5 trillion yen worth of six-month Treasury bills, or &quot;tankoku&quot;, produced the following results, the Ministry of Finance said on Monday:</p>
<p>Lowest price     99.710  Stop rate     0.567 pct</p>
<p>Average price    99.714  Average yield 0.558 pct</p>
<p>Total bids	   4.0428  trillion yen</p>
<p>Accepted Bids	1.4997  trillion yen</p>
<p>Bids accepted at lowest price 10.7753pct</p>
<p>Issue date	 July 10, 1997</p>
<p>Maturity	   Jan  12, 1998</p>
</text>
